<title>USA: Union Pacific responds to Pennzoil.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific responds to Pennzoil.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Pacific Resources Group Inc said Wednesday that a lawsuit filed by Pennzoil Co raises no issues that should get in the way of its attempt to acquire the oil company.</p>
<p>Pennzoil filed the lawsuit, accusing Union Pacific Resources of failing to disclose earnings dilution that would result from the acquisition.</p>
<p>Union Pacific Resources has launched a hostile bid to acquire Pennzoil for about $6.4 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;This lawsuit is no surprise,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;It raises absolutely no issues that are an impediment to our offer. The lawsuit is a predictable and desperate measure by a management that refuses to address straightforwardly a very powerful and attractive offer we have made to Pennzoil shareholders.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
